# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (default mode is "production").
#
# Left blank on purpose: a production build is served by the same Express
# origin that answers /api/... (see server/src/app.ts's static-file serving
# and docs/showcase-tunnel.md), so the browser should call the API relative
# to whatever host it was loaded from — http://localhost:4000 and
# https://<random>.trycloudflare.com alike — rather than a hardcoded origin
# that only matches one of them.
#
# A genuinely split-origin production deployment (frontend and API on
# different hosts) overrides this in a git-ignored client/.env.production.local.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
